  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"2026.14\"\n\npackage:\n  name: shader-slang\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  - url: https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n    sha256: 6782f3bc48864fa179d1fb875a172b9c53cb0fd768a3241ff470fb1ccaca97ec\n    target_directory: shader-slang\n    patches:\n      - 0001-add-public-latest-capability-aliases.patch\n      - 0002-use-system-fast-float.patch\n      - 0003-use-system-lua.patch\n      - 0004-use-system-lz4-from-pkg-config.patch\n      - 0005-use-system-cmark.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - cmake\n    - ninja\n    - if: unix\n      then: pkg-config\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n  host:\n    - cmark-gfm >=0.29.0.gfm.13\n    - fast_float >=8.1.0\n    - libvulkan-headers\n    - lz4-c >=1.10.0\n    - lua >=5.4.7,<5.5\n    - miniz >=3.1.1\n    - spirv-headers >=1.4.350.1\n    - unordered_dense >=4.8.1\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    from_package:\n      - lua\n  run_constraints:\n    - slang <0.0\n    - slang-verilog <0.0\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage('shader-slang', upper_bound='x.x') }}\n\ntests:\n  - if: unix\n    then:\n      - script:\n          - slangc --help\n          - test -d \"$PREFIX/include/slang\"\n          - test -f \"$PREFIX/lib/libslang${SHLIB_EXT}\"\n  - if: win\n    then:\n      - script:\n          - slangc.exe --help\n          - if not exist \"%LIBRARY_LIB%\\slang.lib\" exit 1\n          - if not exist \"%LIBRARY_BIN%\\slang.dll\" exit 1\n          - if not exist \"%LIBRARY_INC%\\slang\" exit 1\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/shader-slang/slang\n  summary: The Slang shading language is designed for large-scale, high-performance shader code.\n  description: |\n    Slang is a shading language that makes it easier to build and maintain large\n    shader codebases in a modular and extensible fashion, while also maintaining\n    the highest possible performance on modern GPUs and graphics APIs.\n  license: Apache-2.0 AND BSD-2-Clause AND MIT\n  license_file:\n    - shader-slang/LICENSE\n  repository: https://github.com/shader-slang/slang\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - JarrettSJohnson\n",
